# Third-party notices

This package ships a modified copy of the DeepSeek Harness trajectory client:

- `src/vendor/trajectory/**` — derived from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-trajectory`
  (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek), copied from the runtime that this plugin
  was built against and modified in place. Files carry `// @ts-nocheck` and keep
  the upstream structure; see `AGENTS.md` for the list of changed files.
- `src/vendor/host/**` — small host-side helpers reproduced from the same
  runtime (`dsh-util-values`, `dsh-llm/assistant-stream`) so the fork compiles
